      "content": "therapists just want to find ways to make me keep going, but what if i don't want to keep going? it feels like life is just this endless cycle of effort for no reward. sometimes i look at the idea of just... stopping... and it's the only thing that actually sounds peaceful. like, wouldn't it be easier to just be still forever instead of fighting this every single second?",
